{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"ipwl@349","phase":"after","pageId":"page@df20202ef8dba6ffc51211243f4338f9","frameId":"frame@458ea20a964f732774ec4b15eb6de2f7","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:5280/","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"de","data-reduced-motion":"false"},[[117,4]],[[119,25]],["BODY",{},[[119,26]],["DIV",{"id":"app","class":"app","aria-busy":"false"},["DIV",{"class":"shell","data-route":"lesson","data-reduced-motion":"false","data-reward-anchor":"0.866:0.000"},[[12,2]],["DIV",{"class":"layer layer-world"},["DIV",{"class":"hud hud--lesson","data-view":"lesson"},["DIV",{"class":"lesson-header"},["DIV",{"class":"lesson-head-main"},["STRONG",{"class":"lesson-point","title":"Lernpunkt: Orientierung"},"Orientierung"],["SPAN",{"class":"lesson-round"},"Runde 2 von 4"],["SPAN",{"class":"tag"},"Gestützte Wiederholung"]],["SPAN",{"class":"mark-counter","role":"status","aria-label":"Schulmarken: 2","data-value":"2"},[[50,12]],["SPAN",{"class":"mark-counter-value","aria-hidden":"true"},"2"]]],["DIV",{"class":"hud-middle"},["DIV",{"class":"card card--dialog card--enter","aria-live":"polite","data-scroll-key":"lesson-card"},["H2",{"class":"card-title"},"Nala schnüffelt"],["P",{"class":"observation-text"},"Ruhiger Hof. Nala schnüffelt langsam am Rand des Wasserplatzes entlang."],["DIV",{"class":"describe-body describe-body--support"},["STRONG",{},"Gestützte Wiederholung: "],"Nala ist beschäftigt, aber die Umgebung ist ruhig. Wenn du wartest, schaut sie von selbst kurz zu dir. Dieser Blick ist der Moment, den wir suchen."],["DIV",{"class":"describe-body","id":"observation-description"},["SPAN",{"class":"describe-label text-secondary"},"Beobachtung beschreiben"],["P",{},"Der Körper ist locker, der Rücken weich, die Nase dicht über dem Boden. Die Ohren hängen entspannt, der Schwanz pendelt langsam. Der Blick folgt der Spur am Boden. Am Wasserplatz ist es ruhig. Nala ist beschäftigt, nicht angespannt."]]]],["DIV",{"class":"dock dock--lesson dock--with-menu","data-scroll-key":"lesson-dock"},["DIV",{"class":"dock-main"},["BUTTON",{"class":"btn btn--primary btn--large btn--block","type":"button","data-key":"next"},["SPAN",{"class":"btn-label"},"Weiter"]]],["BUTTON",{"class":"btn btn--secondary btn--icon","type":"button","aria-label":"Menü","data-key":"more"},["SPAN",{"class":"btn-icon","aria-hidden":"true"},["svg",{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round"},["path",{"d":"M6 12h.01M12 12h.01M18 12h.01"}]]]]]]],[[50,37]],[[50,38]],[[117,54]],[[50,39]],[[117,57]]]],[[119,28]],[[119,29]]]],"viewport":{"width":360,"height":640},"timestamp":75612.852,"wallTime":1791648211085,"collectionTime":0.19999998807907104,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
{"type":"before","callId":"ipwl@352","startTime":75613.596,"class":"Frame","method":"evaluateExpression","params":{"expression":"() => new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const request = indexedDB.open('pfotenzeit');\n    request.onerror = () => reject(request.error);\n    request.onsuccess = () => {\n      const db = request.result;\n      const transaction = db.transaction(['meta', 'saves']);\n      let meta, saves;\n      transaction.objectStore('meta').get('meta').onsuccess = event => {\n        meta = event.target.result;\n      };\n      transaction.objectStore('saves').getAll().onsuccess = event => {\n        saves = event.target.result;\n      };\n      transaction.oncomplete = () => {\n        db.close();\n        resolve(saves.find(s => s.saveId === meta.saveIds[meta.activeMode]));\n      };\n      transaction.onerror = () => {\n        db.close();\n        reject(transaction.error);\n      };\n    };\n  })","isFunction":true,"arg":{"value":{"v":"undefined"},"handles":[]}}}
